{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487576-supernatural-thieves-stealing-in-the-chrod","id":1487576,"title":"Supernatural thieves: stealing in the Chrod","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-23T06:12:00-07:00","id":1487576,"title":"Supernatural thieves: stealing in the Chrod","content":"Recently, I have dug up an old character concept for a thief, which lead to me musing how to build as efficient a burglar-pickpocketeer style character in regards to the different splats.<br /> <br /> So, here we are. I'd like to hear your opinions: what stats and merits should a thief absolutely have? Which splat lends itself most for someone in the possession-relocation business in your opinion, and why?<br /> <br /> <b>Clarification:</b> I mostly think of the &quot;gone with the goods before anyone is the wiser&quot; variety, able to enter places they are not meant to, and take stuff they are not supposed to, all the while not being seen (think more Thief's Garret, less Ocean's Eleven). Pulling social capers a la Gentlemen Bastards is entirely optional, and fighting ability is a very distant thought. Actual use of force is more the domain of bandits and raiders and not the focus here.<br /> <br /> Personally, I think pickpockets should have high Dexterity, Larceny, and Sleight of Hand is an absolute must-have. I like to go for stuff like Patient and Good Time Management when I want to highlight a calm and steady hand and mind. Some points in Investigation to reflect the ability to scoop out a place, and Athletics to help with running away. Streetwise, obviously, to sell off the goods, which makes a Shady Pawn Shop or Fence as a Contact a good investment. Supernatural powers should increase utility, e.g. new modes of movement, or help with not being seen by removing one from sight or helping to get rid of traces/laying false clues. <br /> <br /> Although all my thieves so far have been Changelings, I think Mekhet and Eshmaki or Ugallu could make for rather effective larcenists. I heard good things about Irraka Iron Masters, but I am not familiar enough with W:tF to see why they are particularly capable. <br /> <br /> <br /> To start off, this was my second Changeling thief, whose run ended 10 xp in. You'll notice surprisingly low Streetwise. which was entirely due to IC-reasons (was considered to have just moved to the chronicle's city, which imo made it unreasonable to have enough knowledge of the local scene). <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Name: Ricky Gazmanov (nicknamed Blacklight)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Seeming (favored attribute): Darkling (Dexterity)</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Kith: Helldiver</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Court: Winter</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Needle: Scholar</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Thread: Friendship</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Concept: Gentleman-Thief, Spy and Explorer of strange worlds</span></span></span><br /> <hr /><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Intelligence: 2</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Wits: 3</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Resolve: 3</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Strength: 2</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Dexterity: 4</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Stamina: 2</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Presence: 2</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Manipulation: 2</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"fon